Need make sure scenery.paving exists after old page until reload. Fine.

Add body collision. In updateGame after all updates, resolve. But enemies update before player? player then enemies. After enemy update, resolve player-enemy. Implement function in app.js updateGame:
```
function resolveBodyCollisions() {
 const p=G.player; if(!p||p.dead) return;
 for (const e of G.enemies) {
   if(e.dead||e.state==='spawn') continue;
   const minZ = e.cfg.boss?.16:.095;
   if (Math.abs(p.z-e.z) > minZ) continue;
   const dx=p.x-e.x;
   const minX = e.cfg.boss?58:42;
   const ad=Math.abs(dx);
   if(ad<minX && ad>0.001){
     const push=(minX-ad)*0.5;
     const s=sign(dx);
     p.x=clamp(p.x+s*push,120,ARENA_W-120);
     e.x=clamp(e.x-s*push,100,ARENA_W-100);
   }
 }
}
```
But this can push enemies into player if player against edge; still okay.

Call after enemy update. Add maybe dust? no.

